      "writtenOn": "2023-06-28T02:21:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This function is used in the slc-pinned function of the storage module.\nSLC-Pinned is a solid-state drive (SSD) storage technology used to improve SSD write performance and reliability.The slc-pinned function needs to get the file inode and its pinned data, so as to determine whether it is pinned. The specific call relationship is as follows: ufswbp_prep_fn--\u003eufswbp_is_coldfile--\u003eufswhint_get_whint--\u003eufswhint_get_inode--\u003epage_file_mapping--\u003efolio_file_mapping-- -\u003eswapcache_mapping",
      "parentUuid": "35e029ac_be61fb0a",
      "revId": "5616315fd941fb22d44fe4332554f56965374c68",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
