        "id": 2010921
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-28T07:19:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi,\nBecause storage needs to obtain the block layer\u0027s request-\u003ebio-\u003ebi_write_hint field for some new memory feature development, and this field has been removed in Android 14 version, So we can only get the bi_write_hint by accessing the inode.\nThanks",
      "parentUuid": "fb34918e_46532555",
      "revId": "5616315fd941fb22d44fe4332554f56965374c68",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
